{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"707","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"關注環保 開雲集團號召32時尚品牌成立永續聯盟","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019-08-28 23:37</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">聯合報 記者吳曉涵／台北報導</span></p>\n\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;<img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/01(1).jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 800px; height: 534px;\\\" /></span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Prada</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">推動全新<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Re-Nylon</span>再生尼龍計畫，目標將品牌所有尼龍面料轉變為再生尼龍<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">ECONYL</span>。 圖／<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Prada</span>提供</span></p>\n\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">因為「地球之肺」亞馬遜雨林的無情大火，環境保護瞬間又成了全球迫切關注的議題。而在今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">G7</span>會議中，相關議題也再度躍升為討論焦點，東道主法國總統馬克宏更是在會議前邀請開雲集團首席執行長<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Fran&ccedil;ois-Henri Pinault</span>擔任召集人，號召全球<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">32</span>個品牌和紡織業代表成立永續聯盟，一起簽署名為《<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Fashion Pact</span>》的契約，等於正式宣告時尚產業共同致力維護環保的決心。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">《<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Fashion Pact</span>》契約聚焦三大議題，分別為減緩氣候變化、恢復五種多樣性、海洋保護，希望眾家品牌能找尋方式消除一次性塑料、減少合成材料的污染。本次響應契約的除了開雲集團之外，更包含多家知名精品龍頭，像是香奈兒、愛馬仕、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Prada</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Giorgio Armani</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Burberry</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Stella McCartney</span>等。擁有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Gucci</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Bottega Veneta</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Balenciaga</span>等人氣品牌的開雲集團，本身則是訂下<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2025</span>年減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">40</span>％環境損益、減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">50</span>％的二氧化碳排放量，並於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2050</span>年前成為一家「零碳足跡」公司的目標。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">事實上，近年來已經有不少品牌致力在「可持續性發展」（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Sustainability<span>&nbsp;</span></span>）議題上，這次簽署《<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Fashion Pact</span>》契約當中的多個品牌也陸續以實際作為展示對環境的友善，比如去年開始禁用珍稀皮革的香奈兒，投資了研發生物分解塑料類材料的芬蘭初創公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Sulapac</span>，並收購開發純天然液態真絲技術的綠色化學公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Evolved By NatureTM</span>的少數股權；<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Prada</span>也與國家地理頻道合作宣傳，推動全新<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Re-Nylon</span>再生尼龍計畫，目標訂於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2021</span>年底之前將品牌所有尼龍面料轉變為再生尼龍<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">ECONYL&reg;</span>；而環保資優生<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Stella McCartney</span>，更是在其最新推出的泰勒絲聯名系列中全面使用可持續有機棉材質。</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">雖然目前《<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Fashion Pact</span>》契約並不具備法律上的約束力，但<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>月將舉辦相關會議進一步提出詳細規劃與其他契約內容。而面對亞馬遜雨林大火、科羅拉多州下起的塑膠雨、歐洲異常高溫侵襲等現象，相信在這些精品龍頭眼中，環保議題刻不容緩的迫切性，已經到了最後關頭。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;<img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/02(1).jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 400px; height: 502px;\\\" /></span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">開雲集團首席執行長<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Fran&ccedil;ois-Henri Pinault(</span>左<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">)</span>號召全球<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">32</span>個品牌和紡織業代表一起簽署名為《<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Fashion Pact</span>》的契約，宣告時尚產業共同致力維護環保的決心。 圖／<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Gucci</span>提供</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;<img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/03(1).jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 400px; height: 444px;\\\" /></span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">環保資優生<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Stella McCartney</span>，更是在其最新推出的泰勒絲聯名系列中全面使用可持續有機棉材質。 圖／摘自<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">IG</span></span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p 255=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;<img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/04.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 800px; height: 533px;\\\" /></span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">香奈兒也加入《<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Fashion Pact</span>》契約成員，並投資研發生物分解塑料類材料的芬蘭初創公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Sulapac</span>，致力研發創新環保面料。 圖／香奈兒提供</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">資料來源：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://udn.com/news/story/11319/4015914</span></span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-09-03","clk_count":"226"}},"__N_SSG":true}